%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: TheGamblerIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  isForced: 1
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Heads or tails? Just habit, I flip something whenever I'm standing still. Papers. Bidzina Chkhonia. Mostly cards.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I've been running numbers on this checkpoint. The variance per pass is bigger than you'd think.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: You time this checkpoint?
      npcResponse: I time everything. Probability doesn't work without data. It's one of my steadier variables.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: Do you play for a living?
      npcResponse: When the living holds still long enough to let me. Right now nothing holds still.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I used to play at the Metropol most nights. That's closed now. Found a private game in someone's basement, lower stakes.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I won't say which eye. But I'd bet on it. My permit, August expiry.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I don't have tells.
      npcResponse: Everybody has tells. I've spent twenty years reading them. It's not an insult, it's data.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
      playLaughSfx: 0
    - playerChoiceText: Does that help at the card table?
      npcResponse: More than the cards, honestly. Cards are just mathematics. People are where the game lives.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
      playLaughSfx: 0
